@k.words.oppression.noun.2 k.words.sense word=oppression pos=noun n=2 gloss="the state of being kept down by unjust use of force or authority: \"after years of oppression they finally revolted\"" is_a=subjugation core.source="wordnet 3.1"
@k.words.oppression.noun.3 k.words.sense word=oppression pos=noun n=3 gloss="a feeling of being oppressed" synonym=oppressiveness is_a=depression core.source="wordnet 3.1"
