@k.words.option.noun.1 k.words.sense word=option pos=noun n=1 gloss="the right to buy or sell property at an agreed price; the right is purchased and if it is not exercised by a stated date the money is forfeited" is_a="derivative instrument" core.source="wordnet 3.1"
@k.words.option.noun.2 k.words.sense word=option pos=noun n=2 gloss="one of a number of things from which only one can be chosen" synonym=alternative synonym=choice is_a="decision making" core.source="wordnet 3.1"
